Quran translations bundled with the shell
=========================================

These files are Quran translations downloaded from the Tanzil Project
(https://tanzil.net/trans/). Each file is plain text with one verse per
line in the form:

    surah|ayah|translation

and ends with Tanzil's own notice block.

Built-in translations:

    en.sahih.txt        Saheeh International (English)
    de.bubenheim.txt    A. S. F. Bubenheim and N. Elyas (German)
    tr.ates.txt         Süleyman Ateş (Turkish)

Other languages are fetched on demand from https://tanzil.net/trans/<id>
and cached under the shell's state directory.

